                        "form": "dem Vitalismus"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7b749908-874c-43d2-950f-635ef2de9255",
                        "entry_id": "ab93874b-f312-381d-9544-30a04c671c8d",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "den Vitalismus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                        "entry_id": "ab93874b-f312-381d-9544-30a04c671c8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Theorie, die im Bereich des Lebens ein transmaterielles, ordnungsstiftendes Prinzip (Entelechie, Élan vital, Vis vitalis etc.) wirken sieht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Naturphilosophie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b21d43c3-fbe2-4f4a-8a18-ac9a22939113",
                                "sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                                "text": "Nach dem Vitalismus sind alle Lebensformen nicht ausschließlich nach physikochemischen Gesetzen entstanden, wenn auch diese als voll wirksam angenommen werden."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "254b5d3b-58eb-4579-b5a5-d4f35086cca8",
                                "sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                                "text": "Der Vitalismus lässt ungezwungener als jeglicher Mechanismus den Glauben an einen persönlichen Schöpfer zu."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a1f361e-a91a-4cdc-8595-906175df0258",
                                "sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                                "text": "„Darin hat Heindel einen Vitalismus vertreten, demzufolge es eine Stufung des Seins gibt, vom materiellen Mineral bis zur geistigen Existenz des Menschen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48e99f7b-e530-4505-a0b3-f2e26d680516",
                                "sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                                "text": "„Afrikanischer Vitalismus als lebendige Religion enthält nach Bulagas Darstellung in sich selbst schon das Prinzip der Grenzsprengung.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "417bd544-e2e7-4129-b8a3-892b11b1590c",
                        "source_entry_id": "ab93874b-f312-381d-9544-30a04c671c8d",
                        "source_sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                        "target_lang_word": "vitalism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vitalism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f5f85d0-e6ad-3b62-8950-2e1c9a3974a2",
                                        "entry_id": "5d319089-60db-35ca-9c25-aec1ff932450",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The doctrine that life involves some immaterial \\\"vital force\\\", and cannot be explained scientifically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e747ab41-c426-4375-9fa2-091648eda851",
                                                "sense_id": "3f5f85d0-e6ad-3b62-8950-2e1c9a3974a2",
                                                "text": "Theories and philosophies of vitalism are concerned with the distinction between life and non-life in some form. Given this emphasis, vitalism always has political stakes: where the boundary between life and non-life is drawn is, as theorists of biopolitics have shown, a supremely political matter […] Historically, vitalism has been associated with conservatism and fascism in ways that are sometimes genealogically defensible, sometimes only with difficulty or not at all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e528f175-d007-4bc8-ae43-fdd482084c16",
                                                "sense_id": "3f5f85d0-e6ad-3b62-8950-2e1c9a3974a2",
                                                "text": "It seems to me that in vitalism, there are people who are anti-Christian, like Bronze Age Pervert, like the Nazis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fbe851fa-558d-4517-abd8-23264b77b354",
                        "source_entry_id": "ab93874b-f312-381d-9544-30a04c671c8d",
                        "source_sense_id": "0fa08661-8828-3631-823d-3a7ef1d0d39f",
                        "target_lang_word": "vitalisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vitalisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3f01aeb-bbc8-3317-bd5f-c4033c86b357",
                                        "entry_id": "c03627f5-d607-35e5-8b8f-e6e17498ead4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doctrine selon laquelle la vie tient d’un phénomène surnaturel qui dépasse les lois de la physique et de la chimie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Didactique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21f3ff9c-3ae0-4632-85a4-49486c943002",
                                                "sense_id": "a3f01aeb-bbc8-3317-bd5f-c4033c86b357",
                                                "text": "Une croyance fondamentale est au cœur du vitalisme : les humains doivent s'adapter à la nature plutôt que la conquérir, la contempler plutôt que la maîtriser."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e891c11-46fd-3272-b87d-0ba741704bbc",
                                        "entry_id": "c03627f5-d607-35e5-8b8f-e6e17498ead4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Théorie selon laquelle le corps humain est animé par une énergie vitale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Médecine non conventionnelle"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62ab28ba-8eb1-43b9-8c07-04044790d787",
                                                "sense_id": "7e891c11-46fd-3272-b87d-0ba741704bbc",
                                                "text": "Je tentais alors de me relever d’un accident qui m’avait coûté plus précieux que la vie : le vitalisme !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
